{"title":"1954 AHSME Problems/Problem 38","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1954_AHSME_Problems/Problem_38&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/e/efeceb010d725d089fdf54e39e7a1fb76af5506a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log 2 = .3010$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"100\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/4/fd43e0cd7c2a9dd1e5e70ae3466abb61b91ab54c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log 3 = .4771$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"100\" height=\"16\" />, the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/0/9/c09e2b0f1779a9ed0e3f334dcfa3614302640ea2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3^{x+3} = 135$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"85\" height=\"15\" /> is approximately\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/e/d/1edab090a716454dd066a6fc9d6d0efee5c0761e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) \\ } 5  \\qquad \\textbf{(B) \\ } 1.47 \\qquad \\textbf{(C) \\ } 1.67 \\qquad \\textbf{(D) \\ } 1.78 \\qquad \\textbf{(E) \\ } 1.63$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"477\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1954_AHSME_Problems/Problem_38&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Taking the logarithm in base <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> of both sides, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/1/b113e38f3b95b87bbf468fba89757fe714914bab.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+3 = \\log_3 135$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"126\" height=\"17\" />. Using the property <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/f/e/5fe3e1a604ab588c3e3d7535bfdeb93d6a02e08c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log ab = \\log a + \\log b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"161\" height=\"16\" />, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/2/d52dc6766e984979480af85df96abcda42ca8192.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+3 = \\log_3 5 + \\log_3 3^3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"180\" height=\"19\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/2/432af341e025814cbce3790a7d9e168fac0997fa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\log_3 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"77\" height=\"17\" />. Converting into base <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/9/8e9d6905ab69dd4e9c223397a2e3b58f62b19969.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\frac{\\log 5}{\\log 3} = \\frac{1 - \\log 2}{\\log 3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"167\" height=\"41\" />. Now, plugging in the values yeilds <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/6/65646728df8e2af86993f32036e0580c6ea2b7bf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B) \\ } 1.47  }$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"85\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1954_AHSME_Problems/Problem_38&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1954_AHSME\" title=\"1954 AHSME\">1954 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1954_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1954 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1954_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1954 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1954\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1954_AHSME_Problems/Problem_37\" title=\"1954 AHSME Problems/Problem 37\">Problem 37</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1954_AHSME_Problems/Problem_39\" title=\"1954 AHSME Problems/Problem 39\">Problem 39</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1954_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1954 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1954_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1954 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1954_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1954 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1954_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1954 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1954_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1954 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1954_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1954 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?titl